From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:17:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple-g5p: implement bounded retained system sleep

Reserve reversible host admission before certifying quiescence and
stamps. Stop the Fender firmware and remove platform power only after
stable-off. Boot over retained shared memory and require a new ALIVE
generation before IRQ or submission admission.

Rebuild host bindings and both pipelined PM epochs without treating
clean sleep as a fault. Freeze and error queued fences on a transition
failure; retain the busy refusal for unsupported states and hibernation.

Assisted-by: LLM
